  "id": "scale-development",
  "term": "scale development",
  "definition": "Scale development is the process of building a measurement scale for a concept by defining what it includes and creating items that represent its dimensions and subthemes. In this context, it refers to the initial steps of turning a conceptualization into a set of proposed items for later refinement and use.",
